{"speciesId":187,"names":{"fr":"Granivol","es":"Hoppip","en":"Hoppip","ja":"ハネッコ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"To keep from being blown away by the wind, they gather in clusters. They do enjoy gentle breezes, though."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"Its body is so light, it must grip the ground firmly with its feet to keep from being blown away."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"It can be carried away on even the gentlest breeze. It may even float all the way to the next town."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"This POKéMON drifts and floats with the wind. If it senses the approach of strong winds, HOPPIP links its leaves with other HOPPIP to prepare against being blown away."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"This POKéMON drifts and floats with the wind. If it senses the approach of strong winds, HOPPIP links its leaves with other HOPPIP to prepare against being blown away."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"This POKéMON drifts and floats with the wind. If it senses the approach of strong winds, a HOPPIP links leaves with others to prepare against being blown away."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"Its body is so light, it must grip the ground firmly with its feet to keep from being blown away."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"To keep from being blown away by the wind, they gather in clusters. They do enjoy gentle breezes, though."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It drifts on winds. It is said that when HOPPIP gather in fields and mountains, spring is on the way."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It drifts on winds. It is said that when HOPPIP gather in fields and mountains, spring is on the way."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It drifts on winds. It is said that when HOPPIP gather in fields and mountains, spring is on the way."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"To keep from being blown away by the wind, they gather in clusters. But they do enjoy gentle breezes."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"Its body is so light, it must grip the ground firmly with its feet to keep from being blown away."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il dérive avec le vent. Sa présence en nombre dans les champs et les montagnes annonce le printemps."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It drifts on winds. It is said that when Hoppip gather in fields and mountains, spring is on the way."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il dérive avec le vent. Sa présence en nombre dans les champs et les montagnes annonce le printemps."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It drifts on winds. It is said that when Hoppip gather in fields and mountains, spring is on the way."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It drifts on winds. It is said that when Hoppip gather in fields and mountains, spring is on the way."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It drifts on winds. It is said that when Hoppip gather in fields and mountains, spring is on the way."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Son corps est si léger qu’il doit s’agripper au sol pour éviter de s’envoler les jours de brise."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Su cuerpo es tan ligero, que debe agarrarse bien al suelo con las patas para no irse con el viento."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Its body is so light, it must grip the ground firmly with its feet to keep from being blown away."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"とても 軽い 体。 吹き飛ばされないよう しっかり 地面を 踏みしめている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il dérive avec le vent. Sa présence en nombre dans les champs et les montagnes annonce le printemps."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Flotan en el aire. Se dice que, cuando los Hoppip se reúnen, es que la primavera está al caer."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It drifts on winds. It is said that when Hoppip gather in fields and mountains, spring is on the way."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"風に 流されて 漂う。 野山に ハネッコが 集まり出すと 春が 訪れると 言われている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Ce Pokémon flotte à la dérive, porté par le vent. S’il sent qu’un vent très fort approche, Granivol attache ses feuilles aux autres Granivol pour ne pas être emporté par la bourrasque."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Este Pokémon flota en el aire y se deja llevar. Cuando percibe que el viento va a cambiar a fuerte, Hoppip entrelaza sus hojas con otros Hoppip para hacer resistencia y evitar salir volando por la fuerza de la corriente."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"This Pokémon drifts and floats with the wind. If it senses the approach of strong winds, Hoppip links its leaves with other Hoppip to prepare against being blown away."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"風に 乗って ふわふわ 漂う ポケモン。 強風の 気配を 感じると 仲間同士 葉っぱを 絡め 飛ばされない 準備をする。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Ce Pokémon flotte à la dérive, porté par le vent. S’il sent qu’un vent très fort approche, Granivol attache ses feuilles aux autres Granivol pour ne pas être emporté par la bourrasque."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Este Pokémon flota en el aire y se deja llevar. Cuando percibe que el viento va a cambiar a fuerte, Hoppip entrelaza sus hojas con otros Hoppip para hacer resistencia y evitar salir volando por la fuerza de la corriente."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"This Pokémon drifts and floats with the wind. If it senses the approach of strong winds, Hoppip links its leaves with other Hoppip to prepare against being blown away."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"風に 乗って ふわふわ 漂う ポケモン。 強風の 気配を 感じると 仲間同士 葉っぱを 絡め 飛ばされない 準備をする。"}],"varieties":[{"id":187,"moves":[{"name":"pay-day","learns":[[3,"egg",0],[4,"egg",0]]},{"name":"swords-dance","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"mac